  x `core/configurable` has no variant `nonexistent`
  help: declared variants: lean

  x list value "Fira Code" on option `fonts` contains whitespace
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-options/image.kdl:12:13]
 11 |         configurable variant="nonexistent" {
 12 |             fonts "Fira Code"
    :             ^^|^^
    :               `-- not usable as this option's value
 13 |             starship "yes"
    `----
  help: list values join on spaces to reach the build, so one containing a
        space would arrive as two

  x option `starship` is a bool, so it takes one #true or #false
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-options/image.kdl:13:13]
 12 |             fonts "Fira Code"
 13 |             starship "yes"
    :             ^^^^|^^^
    :                 `-- not usable as this option's value
 14 |             colour "blue"
    `----
  help: bools reach the build as 1 or 0

  x `core/configurable` has no option `colour`
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-options/image.kdl:14:13]
 13 |             starship "yes"
 14 |             colour "blue"
    :             ^^^|^^
    :                `-- not declared by this component
 15 |             starship #true
    `----
  help: declared options: fonts, starship

  x `starship` is set twice on `core/configurable`
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-options/image.kdl:15:13]
 14 |             colour "blue"
 15 |             starship #true
    :             ^^^^|^^^
    :                 `-- set again here
 16 |         }
    `----
  help: resolution is a single pass, so a second value is an error
